Short:        Asm source for a Disk Magazine.
Author:       misc1664@csc.canterbury.ac.nz
Uploader:     misc1664 csc canterbury ac nz
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

	This is an asm source of a Disk Magazine. It runs on a copperlist
of cource, has compression and decompression of articles etc.. and many other
things Disk Magazines have. It is semi-well coded , compiles upon minor
alterations, and is uploaded for your perusal.
